#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:65
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_TakeRestOnBed"
msgid ""
"There's a bed…\n"
"Let's take a rest.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:69
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_ColtonIntro"
msgid ""
"I often sail to LILYCOVE CITY.\p"
"I enjoy attending CONTESTS,\n"
"you see.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:74
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_ColtonDefeat"
msgid "That was an enjoyable match!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:77
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_ColtonPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I get so excited imagining what kinds\n"
"of POKéMON I'll get to see in the next\l"
"CONTEST. The anticipation of it thrills!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:82
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_MicahIntro"
msgid "Are your friends strong?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:85
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_MicahDefeat"
msgid "Your friends are, indeed, strong.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:88
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_MicahPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Friends need not be human.\n"
"For me, POKéMON are treasured friends!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:92
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_ThomasIntro"
msgid ""
"Child…\n"
"Did you knock on the door?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:96
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_ThomasDefeat"
msgid ""
"A loss is to be accepted without haste\n"
"or panic.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:100
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_ThomasPostBattle"
msgid ""
"To be never ruffled in any situation is\n"
"the GENTLEMAN's code of conduct.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:104
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_JedIntro"
msgid ""
"JED: I feel a little shy about this, but…\n"
"We'll show you our lovey-dovey power!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:108
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_JedDefeat"
msgid "JED: Sigh…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:111
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_JedPostBattle"
msgid ""
"JED: It's the first time that our lovey-\n"
"dovey power couldn't prevail!\l"
"You must be an awesome TRAINER!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:116
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_JedNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"JED: You only have one POKéMON?\n"
"Isn't that just too lonesome?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:120
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_LeaIntro"
msgid ""
"LEA: I feel a little silly, but…\n"
"We'll show you our lovey-dovey power!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:124
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_LeaDefeat"
msgid "LEA: Oh, boo!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:127
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_LeaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"LEA: I can't believe it!\n"
"Our lovey-dovey power failed…\l"
"You must be an awesome TRAINER!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:132
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_LeaNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"LEA: I wanted to battle…\n"
"But you don't even have two POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:136
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_GarretIntro"
msgid ""
"Ah, you've come just in time.\p"
"I'm bored, you see.\n"
"You may entertain me.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:141
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_GarretDefeat"
msgid "…That will do.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:144
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_GarretPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Perhaps I shall get Father to acquire\n"
"a yacht for me.\l"
"A yacht for me and POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:149
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_NaomiIntro"
msgid ""
"Oh, you're such an adorable TRAINER.\n"
"Would you like to have tea?\l"
"Or would you rather battle?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:154
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_NaomiDefeat"
msgid ""
"I see.\n"
"You're the active sort.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:158
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_NaomiPostBattle"
msgid ""
"A world cruise on a luxury liner has its\n"
"charms, I must say…\p"
"But, I will admit there is an appealing\n"
"side to touring HOENN by ferry.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:164
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_NotSuspiciousTakeThis"
msgid ""
"Uh… Hi! I… I'm not acting suspicious!\n"
"Uh… You can have this! For free!\p"
"It… Honestly, I didn't SNATCH it from\n"
"someone! I'd never do such a thing!\l"
"It's clean! You can use it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SSTidalRooms/scripts.inc:171
msgctxt "SSTidalRooms_Text_ExplainSnatch"
msgid ""
"SNATCH steals the beneficial effects\n"
"of certain moves before they can be\l"
"used by a foe or ally.$"
msgstr ""
